{"id":"d6baae1c4b76f905","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-prop-cardinal-successor.md","title":"Cardinal Successor","display":"prop-cardinal-successor — Cardinal Successor","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-cardinal-successor","aliases":["58-prop-cardinal-successor"],"display":"prop-cardinal-successor — Cardinal Successor","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-cardinal-successor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-cardinal-successor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-cardinal-successor — Cardinal Successor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu\\in V\\)</span> (set-theoretic parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (successor-cardinal relation characterized here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}successor\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\mu,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\n\\land\\kappa\\in\\mu\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mu\\;\n(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\lambda\\subseteq\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}successor\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\mu,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\n\\land\\kappa\\in\\mu\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mu\\;\n(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\lambda\\subseteq\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists!\\mu\\in V\\;\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\mu,\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists!\\mu\\in V\\;\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\mu,\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The binary relation avoids treating <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^+\">\\(\\kappa^+\\)</span> as an already-defined set-valued operator; its unique output is the least cardinal strictly larger than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Even for infinite <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>, the successor cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^+\">\\(\\kappa^+\\)</span> is generally not the successor ordinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa+1\">\\(\\kappa+1\\)</span>; the latter is equipotent with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}successor\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\mu,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\n\\land\\kappa\\in\\mu\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mu\\;\n(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\lambda\\subseteq\\kappa).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists!\\mu\\in V\\;\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\mu,\\kappa).","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1357,"backlinks":[{"id":"1a076c75424467df","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"43f4d656f23ee5d4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-prop-cardinal-successor]])"},{"i